{"id":1765818,"retrievedAt":"2026-09-08T15:18:31.930Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":99,"name":"Documentary"}],"homepage":"","id":1765818,"imdb_id":"tt0950580","origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Colorful Ceylon","overview":"It is not often that your patrons will get a chance to take a trip through a veritable Garden of Eden. On his trip Burton Holmes will show them many strange and unusual sights of the Far East that they never before have witnessed, such as a Buddhist funeral procession of a much beloved saint. Don't run away with the idea that this is going to be sad, far from it. It will appeal to them the more like a joyous Carnival when they see it, the beautiful water falls of St. Clair, the tea fields and hosts of other sights equally interesting, finally the journey ends up with a water scene, showing the Cingalese people taking on the best sport in the land, bathing.","popularity":0.0143,"poster_path":null,"production_companies":[{"id":95953,"logo_path":null,"name":"Burton Holmes Travel Pictures","origin_country":"US"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","name":"United States of America"}],"release_date":"1917-05-07","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"No Language","iso_639_1":"xx","name":"No Language"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Colorful Ceylon","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"credits":{"cast":[],"crew":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":2400469,"known_for_department":"Directing","name":"Burton Holmes","original_name":"Burton Holmes","popularity":0.3715,"profile_path":null,"credit_id":"6a9f19d7ed6b80cb615b0604","department":"Production","job":"Producer"}]},"alternative_titles":{"titles":[{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"In Colorful Ceylon","type":""}]},"external_ids":{"imdb_id":"tt0950580","wikidata_id":null,"facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"images":{"backd